    "q-182613": {
      "dom_id": "step-q182613",
      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "Find the missing values in the following truth table:\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,A∧(B∨¬A)\\,$ | $\\,A∧B\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-1}} | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-3}} | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nUsing your results, complete the following statement:\n\n$$\nA∧(B∨¬A){{field-4}}A∧B\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's solve for the missing values:\n\n- When $A≡\\text{T}$ and $B≡\\text{T},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A∧(B∨¬A) & ≡\\text{T}∧(\\text{T}∨¬\\text{T}) \\\\  & ≡\\text{T}∧(\\text{T}∨\\text{F}) \\\\  & ≡\\text{T}∧\\text{T} \\\\  & ≡\\text{T}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- When $A≡\\text{T}$ and $B≡\\text{F},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A∧B & ≡\\text{T}∧\\text{F} \\\\  & ≡\\text{F}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- When $A≡\\text{F}$ and $B≡\\text{T},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A∧(B∨¬A) & ≡\\text{F}∧(\\text{T}∨¬\\text{F}) \\\\  & ≡\\text{F}∧(\\text{T}∨\\text{T}) \\\\  & ≡\\text{F}∧\\text{T} \\\\  & ≡\\text{F}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nOur completed table is shown below.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,A∧(B∨¬A)\\,$ | $\\,A∧B\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nTo determine whether $A∧(B∨¬A)$ is logically equivalent to $A∧B,$ we need to check whether their truth tables are equivalent.  \n\nLooking at the last two columns, we see that they are the same $(\\text{T},\\text{F},\\text{F},\\text{F}).$ Therefore, we conclude that \n\n$$\nA∧(B∨¬A)≡A∧B.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
